WEBVTT

00:00.054 --> 00:07.507
Radeon V L A Reflex is a language-guided sorting system for the Track Three Physical A I Challenge.
RadeonVLA-Reflex 是面向 Track 3 Physical AI 挑战赛的语言引导分拣系统。

00:07.507 --> 00:15.504
It combines a vision-language-action policy with an execution layer that checks commands and joint actions before they reach the robot.
它将视觉语言动作策略与执行层结合，在控制机械臂前检查指令与关节动作。

00:15.627 --> 00:22.507
Our Genesis testbed uses a Franka arm, five Y C B fruits, and four language-addressable bowls.
我们的 Genesis 测试台包含 Franka 机械臂、五种 YCB 水果和四个语言可指定碗。

00:22.507 --> 00:28.931
White and blue bowls on both sides create twenty exact tasks using the same language as data collection.
左右两侧的白色和蓝色碗构成二十项任务，并沿用数据采集时的语言。

00:29.060 --> 00:34.856
Smol V L A receives two cameras, nine-dimensional robot state, and language.
SmolVLA 接收双路相机、九维机器人状态与语言指令。

00:34.856 --> 00:42.388
It predicts absolute joint-position actions for the arm and gripper, while the runtime enforces limits and command authority.
模型预测机械臂和夹爪的绝对关节位置，运行时同时执行限幅与指令权限检查。

00:42.493 --> 00:44.214
Each command has a version.
每条指令都有版本号。

00:44.214 --> 00:48.862
When the destination changes, queued actions from the old version lose authority.
目标改变时，旧版本中排队的动作立即失去执行权限。

00:48.862 --> 00:54.701
The controller clears its cache, holds safely, and continues only with the current instruction.
控制器清空缓存、安全保持，并仅按当前指令继续执行。

00:54.831 --> 00:57.827
These clips show data collection before training.
这些画面展示训练前的数据采集过程。

00:57.827 --> 01:07.981
A strict-physics expert approaches, grasps, lifts, transports, releases, and keeps recording until the fruit is visibly settled in the requested bowl.
严格物理专家依次完成接近、抓取、抬升、搬运与释放，并持续录制至水果在目标碗中稳定。

01:08.108 --> 01:15.835
Physical Two K contains two thousand successful episodes and over four hundred sixty-eight thousand dual-camera frames.
Physical-2K 包含两千条成功轨迹和超过四十六万八千帧双相机数据。

01:15.835 --> 01:22.365
Every task has one hundred demonstrations, independent seeds, and a validator-checked certificate.
每项任务都有一百条演示、独立 seed 和通过校验的证书。

01:22.480 --> 01:27.371
Grasp attachment, object teleportation, and placement nudges are disabled.
抓取粘附、物体瞬移和放置微调均被禁用。

01:27.371 --> 01:31.363
Trajectories preserve contact and gravity through release.
轨迹从抓取到释放始终保留接触与重力物理。

01:31.363 --> 01:36.917
The website shows successful apple, banana, and plum collection examples with settled endings.
网站展示苹果、香蕉和李子的成功采集样例，并保留稳定结尾。

01:37.035 --> 01:44.989
Simulation, collection, training, and evaluation run on one AMD Radeon G P U through ROCm.
仿真、采集、训练和评测通过 ROCm 运行在一张 AMD Radeon GPU 上。

01:44.989 --> 01:54.057
PyTorch, Genesis, and LeRobot export JSON, C S V, video, and SHA two fifty-six evidence.
PyTorch、Genesis 与 LeRobot 链路输出 JSON、CSV、视频和 SHA256 证据。

01:54.172 --> 02:07.560
The qualitative showcase uses the public twenty-thousand-step checkpoint trained on Physical One K. Fifty-thousand and two-hundred-thousand versions remain separate downloads, letting reviewers compare them without replacing the original.
定性展示使用在 Physical-1K 上训练的公开二万步权重。 五万步和二十万步版本保留为独立下载，便于评审比较且不覆盖原始权重。

02:07.684 --> 02:13.743
Here the twenty K policy receives the collected banana instruction and completes the white-left task first try.
这里二万步策略接收采集原文，并首次完成香蕉到左侧白碗任务。

02:13.743 --> 02:19.927
Recording continues after release, showing the banana inside the bowl and the withdrawn gripper.
释放后仍继续录制，可清楚看到香蕉位于碗中且夹爪已经撤离。

02:20.048 --> 02:25.129
A second twenty K rollout completes another command through the same interface.
第二段二万步回放通过相同接口完成另一条分拣指令。

02:25.129 --> 02:34.269
This walkthrough includes only successful executions, while complete machine-readable evaluation files remain separate from the presentation reel.
本解说仅展示成功执行，完整机器可读评测文件则与展示视频分开提供。

02:34.394 --> 02:37.378
Quality control checks every final frame.
质量检查覆盖每段视频的最后一帧。

02:37.378 --> 02:45.279
A clip is published only when the correct object is released into the correct bowl and remains there throughout a two-second simulation dwell.
仅当正确物体释放进入正确碗，并在两秒仿真观察期间保持稳定时，视频才会发布。

02:45.401 --> 02:48.993
The website provides an evidence console and download center.
网站提供证据控制台与下载中心。

02:48.993 --> 03:00.231
Physical One K, Physical Two K, twenty K, fifty K, two hundred K, source, evaluations, successful videos, checksums, and this walkthrough have public links.
Physical-1K、Physical-2K、二万步、五万步、二十万步、源码、评测、成功视频、校验和与本解说均有公开链接。

03:00.348 --> 03:09.350
The result is a complete Radeon workflow from language and vision to physical action, verified data, trained weights, and inspectable evidence.
最终形成从语言和视觉到物理动作、验证数据、训练权重与可审查证据的完整 Radeon 工作流。

03:09.350 --> 03:18.442
Radeon V L A Reflex demonstrates controllable sorting in Genesis with clear provenance and successful outcomes viewers can verify.
RadeonVLA-Reflex 在 Genesis 中展示来源清晰、结果可验证的可控分拣。
